  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "It's great to see you again, Wizard. Word on the wind is you're a master of righting wrongs. I could really use someone like that right now.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Zander_MIR_14.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340970,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I recently took a sharp but rather thorny Initiate named Briar under my wing. He's a talented Theurgist, but lacks respect for the little things.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Zander_MIR_15.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340970,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So I tried to illustrate the simple complexities of Life to him by using Kookaburra Eggs as an example.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Zander_MIR_16.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340970,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But Briar mistook my attempt to inspire as me undercutting his skill. Enraged, he grabbed the Kookaburra Eggs and ran.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Zander_MIR_17.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340970,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I fear he'll corrupt those innocent Kookaburras, but I lack the aggression to confront the bristly Briar. Will you rescue them?",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Zander_MIR_18.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340970,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Underway",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "AR-ARC-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Please, Wizard. Save the lives of those poor, innocent Kookaburras from the likes of the thorny Briar.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Zander_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue_MIR|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/Zander_MIR_19.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1340970,
